{"title":"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of three numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The first is four times the sum of the other two. The second is seven times the third. What is the product of all three? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a154d350c4aeaa17d1d68fcbca91957e0ebc65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 28\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 40\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 100\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 400\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"414\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let the numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> in that order. The given tells us that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/3/7a3c7259bf897aaa8d70fe3fc3a0ef46eb9bd955.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*}y&amp;=&amp;7z\\\\ x&amp;=&amp;4(y+z)=4(7z+z)=4(8z)=32z\\\\ x+y+z&amp;=&amp;32z+7z+z=40z=20\\\\ z&amp;=&amp;\\frac{20}{40}=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\ y&amp;=&amp;7z=7\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{7}{2}\\\\ x&amp;=&amp;32z=32\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=16 \\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"398\" height=\"195\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the product of all three numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/a/8aa65506bd04a85817d2d2cf2dad6f86c337af58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz=16\\cdot\\frac{7}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}=28 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"258\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Alternatively, we can set up the system in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> form:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fadc3a5f0981faf72eef12e555c48cd64cf770a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*}1x+1y+1z&amp;=&amp;20\\\\ 1x-4y-4z&amp;=&amp;0\\\\ 0x+1y-7z&amp;=&amp;0\\\\ \\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"165\" height=\"66\" />\n</p><p>Or, in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Matrix\" title=\"Matrix\">matrix</a> form\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/c/09c306099469a000a43c917b2df90b8fb89ecd10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{bmatrix} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1 &amp; -4 &amp; -4 \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; -7 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\\\ z \\\\ \\end{bmatrix} =\\begin{bmatrix} 20 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"210\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>To solve this matrix equation, we can rearrange it thus:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b138ec1fcbe221305a4dd1d29b490d1bb4c09b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\\\ z \\\\ \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1 &amp; -4 &amp; -4 \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; -7 \\end{bmatrix} ^{-1} \\begin{bmatrix} 20 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"228\" height=\"67\" />\n</p><p>Solving this matrix equation by using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inverse_matrices&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Inverse matrices (page does not exist)\">inverse matrices</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Matrix_multiplication&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Matrix multiplication (page does not exist)\">matrix multiplication</a> yields\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a14ef765af83184da001ba68515ea35046f59223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{bmatrix} x \\\\ y \\\\ z \\\\ \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{7}{2} \\\\ 16 \\\\ \\end{bmatrix}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -28px\" width=\"102\" height=\"66\" />\n</p><p>Which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3d0dd078cd22a77879cb9fd52d6450b66322a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{7}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/c/7ec4fd697488707ede081f47f633f062efe506e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b89fda2ca20a588e5d0642b379ef6cdfbaaa7882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xyz = \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{7}{2}\\cdot16 = 28 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"258\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let's denote the 3rd number as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, the 2nd as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d8dd5f375b5f3874868d24a8820fe854a68a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, and the 1st as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f113f19ab069acddad349d417214e9f8a440430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(7x+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" /> according to the information given in the problem. We know that all three numbers add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d23ad8f36c7ca203f3a23067d715c81c31ddd713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(8x)+7x+x = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"161\" height=\"20\" />. Solving the equation we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />. Then substitute this value of x to solve for the other two numbers. Lastly, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> as the product of all three numbers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3hY9YXqn5zg\">https://youtu.be/3hY9YXqn5zg</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7V2k1WxooJ0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7V2k1WxooJ0</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A\">2003 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017143502\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 224/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4883/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.329      1 -total\n 60.15%    8.017      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 38.88%    5.182      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4117:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017143502 and revision id 197192. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}